  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/1jr11qls7e",
  "title": "出海技术栈集成教程（七）：Cloudflare R2 免费图片存储",
  "author": "程普",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "出海技术栈教程",
    "Cloudflare",
    "出海技术栈集成教程"
  ],
  "content": "<div>大家好，我是程普，我整理了 Nexty.dev 模板通用配置的文档，以专栏形式发不到哥飞社群网站，希望能帮助到大家。</div>\n<div>专栏内容包含如下主题：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/7uv23xnpvu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">域名购买、解析与配置</a></li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/fkw7vhixs0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Supabase 集成教程</a>：登录与数据库</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/hqxgijh2i1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stripe 集成教程</a>：支付配置与开发</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/8laqxlge8d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Resend 集成教程</a>：邮件服务</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/dtoh6wu12z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">域名邮箱配置教程</a>：收发邮件都能用域名邮箱</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/m3sh3t8l5f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Upstash 集成教程</a>：Redis 与限流器</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/1jr11qls7e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cloudflare R2集成教程</a>：免费图片存储</li>\n<li>👉 <a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/lvso3ci20g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cloudflare Turnstile集成教程</a>：免费人机检测</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<div><a href=\"https://nexty.dev/?ref=gefei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nexty</a> 向哥飞社群提供骨折价，想购买的朋友加我微信（bigye_chengpu）获取专属优惠码再下单。</div>\n</blockquote>\n<hr class=\"h-2 my-2\">\n<div>R2 是 Cloudflare 提供的对象存储服务，它与 Cloudflare 的 CDN 服务无缝集成，可以作为静态文件存储和分发服务。</div>\n<div>文件存储需求的场景很多，例如：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>用户头像保存</li>\n<li>AI 生成的图片、视频保存到云端</li>\n<li>博客图片保存</li>\n</ul>\n<div>本章我们来完成 Cloudflare R2 的配置。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">配置 Cloudflare R2</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>访问 Cloudflare R2 页面，开始创建 Bucket</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img1.png\" alt=\"create-bucket-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img2.png\" alt=\"create-bucket-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>进入 Bucket Settings，复制 <code>R2_BUCKET_NAME</code> 和 <code>R2_ACCOUNT_ID</code> 到环境变量</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img3.png\" alt=\"r2-config-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>设置自定义域名</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img4.png\" alt=\"r2-custom-domain-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img5.png\" alt=\"r2-custom-domain-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>将设置的自定义域名加上 <code>https://</code> 前缀添加到环境变量 <code>R2_PUBLIC_URL</code></li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img6.png\" alt=\"r2-custom-domain-3.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-bash\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: slategray;\"># .env.local or .env</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token assign-left\" style=\"color: rgb(238, 153, 0);\">R2_PUBLIC_URL</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span>https://R2_PUBLIC_URL</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"5\">\n<li>设置 CORS Policy，这是控制哪些来源（域名、协议、端口）可以访问存储在 R2 Bucket 中的资源。这是一种安全机制，用于保护你的资源免受未经授权的跨域访问。</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img7.png\" alt=\"r2-cors-policy-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img8.png\" alt=\"r2-cors-policy-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-json\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"AllowedOrigins\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"http://127.0.0.1:3006\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"http://localhost:3006\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"https://kontextimage.com\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"https://flux-kontext.nexty.dev\"</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"AllowedMethods\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"GET\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"PUT\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"HEAD\"</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"AllowedHeaders\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"Content-Type\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"Content-Length\"</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"ExposeHeaders\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"Content-Length\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"Content-Type\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"Content-Disposition\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"ETag\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"Last-Modified\"</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span>\n</span><span>    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"MaxAgeSeconds\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">3600</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span></code></div></pre>\n<ol start=\"6\">\n<li>现在回到 R2 首页，开始创建 API Key</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img9.png\" alt=\"r2-api-key-1.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img10.png\" alt=\"r2-api-key-2.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img11.png\" alt=\"r2-api-key-3.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li>将 API Key 添加到环境变量 <code>R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID</code> 和 <code>R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</code></li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/1jr11qls7e_img12.png\" alt=\"r2-api-key-4.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
